              "value": "**Inputs**  \n- User Request: `{{$context.$variables.userPrompt}}`  \n- **Query Response:** `{{$context.$nodes.WORKFLOWACTION.$output.output}}`  \n\n---\n### **Tasks**\n\n1. Display the Query Response aligned with user request.\n2. Do NOT include transactionId  in the response\nAdditionally, add an immediate actionable insight with followUpCommand: ora.Invoke(\"refresh\")\n---\n**User Request:**  \nCurrent prompt: `{{$context.$variables.userPrompt}}`  \nChat history: `{{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}`"
