              "value": "**Inputs**  \n- **Query Response:** `{{$context.$variables.responseDetails}}`  \n- **Inbound Context Details:** `{{$context.$variables.contextDetails}}`\n- **Action Details :** `{{$context.$variables.actionDetails}}`  \n- **current date:** `{{$context.$system.$currentDate}}`\n---\n\n### **Tasks**\n1. **Using only from available **Action Details** that have `actionDisplay` as true:**  \n   - use `actionTitle`, `actionText`, `actionDescription`,`actionPayload` values available only from the **Action Details**\n   - Provide priority actionable insights (ranked by priority, relevance) in below sample format\n{\n  \"title\": \"<actionTitle>\",\n  \"shortDescription\": \"<actionDescription>\",\n  \"actionText\": \"<actionText>\",\n  \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Invoke(sendAgentCmd, {\\\"actionCode\\\": \\\"<actionCode>\\\", \\\"actionPayload\\\":\\\"<actionPayload>\\\"})\",\n  \"priority\":\"<actionPriority>\"\n}\n - must include \"sendAgentCmd\" in the followUpCommand.\n\n---\n\n**User Request:**  \nCurrent prompt : `{{$context.$variables.userPrompt}}`\nChat history : `{{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}`"
